OL,3,AIndian singer Anuv Jain on finding
OL,4,Asuccess without the Bollywood boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FCan you find success as an Indian
OL,7,Fartist, outside of the Bollywood
OL,8,Fmachine, while making music that feels
OL,9,Flike you?
OL,11,FWell according to Anuv Jain it's
OL,12,Fpossible - and you can even create
OL,13,Fsomething "beautiful".
OL,15,FThe singer-songwriter's soft vocals
OL,16,Fhave gained hundreds of millions of
OL,17,Fviews on YouTube - not an easy feat as
OL,18,Fan independent artist in India's music
OL,19,Fscene.
